WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
[Low synth swell]
[A glass globe of light dots turns inside a ring of screens]
Explore what you love. Discover where it lives.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.400
[Soft metallic ticks]
[City labels pass as it turns: MIAMI, SAN JUAN, LONDON, TOKYO]

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.400
Music, film, fashion, food — WHAT
Cities, scenes, neighbourhoods — WHERE
Eras, movements, roots — WHEN

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.800
[The chord shifts]
WHERE / NEIGHBOURHOOD BY NEIGHBOURHOOD
Miami, up close.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.800
[Pins drop on an isometric Miami]
01 SOUTH BEACH · 02 WYNWOOD · 03 LITTLE HAVANA · 04 BRICKELL

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.800
[The city sinks back into its grid]
ILLUSTRATIVE MAP, NOT TO SCALE

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.600
[The chord shifts]
Miami · 25.76° N 80.19° W
Latin & house · Neon noir · Resort wear

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.200
[Breathy noise swells and fades]
New York · 40.71° N 74.01° W
Hip-hop & jazz · Street cinema · Runway looks

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.700
London · 51.51° N 0.13° W
Indie & grime · Period drama · Tailoring

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.200
Tokyo · 35.68° N 139.69° E
City pop · Anime & drama · Street style

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.200
Rio · 22.91° S 43.17° W
Samba & funk · Carnival stories · Beachwear

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.800
[The chord shifts]
[A navy passport]
CULTURE PASSPORT · MONUMENTAL STREAMS

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.200
WAVEMAKERS · PLANNED ROUTE: Miami to London
ONE STAMP PER STOP: Trail Stamps

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.600
[Stamps land: MIAMI 01, SAN JUAN 02, NEW YORK 03, LONDON 04]
SAVED TRAIL · 4 STOPS

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.600
[The passport closes]

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.000
[The chord shifts]
TAKE ME SOMEWHERE · DISCOVERY INSTRUMENT
[The dials try MUSIC, FASHION, 30 and 60 MIN]

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.200
[WHERE turns to TOKYO, then MOOD to CHILL]
READY — PRESS GO

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.100
[A ticket prints: MIAMI · 30 MIN]
PRINTING TICKET · TICKET READY

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.600
[Music fades out]
